    <string name="conv_encrypt_needs_so">This encryption mode needs a .so file. Please pick a .so file, or switch the encryption mode to \"Off\".</string>
    <string name="conv_done_title_encrypt_only">Encryption Complete 🔒</string>
    <string name="conv_done_body_encrypt_only">Two files were created in MonToolKit/Converter:\n• %1$s\n• %2$s\n\nThe .enc file is the encrypted library (IV is the first 16 bytes). The keyinfo.txt has the Base64 AES-256 key — keep it safe, without it the .enc can\'t be decrypted.</string>
